ay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608020/extras/acdd5f4168988d145c43954b79159f83.poster.avif?t=1754007368\" width=601 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608020/extras/acdd5f4168988d145c43954b79159f83.webm?t=1754007368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 <strong>Card Games</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try your luck with cards and build the best hand. Big rewards may be one move away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608020/extras/21822b954e918936f53c7457c4229084.poster.avif?t=1754007368\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608020/extras/21822b954e918936f53c7457c4229084.webm?t=1754007368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608020/extras/21822b954e918936f53c7457c4229084.mp4?t=1754007368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 <strong>Scratch Cards</strong><br>Scratch to reveal surprises. If lucky, win big!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 <strong>Coin Flip Bets</strong><br>Simple but thrilling! Heads or tails? Bet and double your money!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608020/extras/f76d87ae2059252bc74105307318fd80.poster.avif?t=1754007368\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608020/extras/f76d87ae2059252bc74105307318fd80.webm?t=1754007368\" type=\"v